		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=42681#p42681"><![CDATA[
There is currently a maximum of 128 links (see MAX_DEGREE_OF_FREEDOM)<br>The intention was for typical robots, which usually have only tens of links.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Tue Mar 10, 2020 4:05 am</p><hr />
